    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Massaman curry serves 4 and takes about 1 hour 50 minutes in total. Most of that is hands-off slow cooking time. The beef becomes very tender and the sauce thickens into something deeply complex."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "You can buy ready-made massaman paste if time is short. Look for it in Asian supermarkets. The depth will be slightly less, but the dish will still be excellent."
          }
        ]
      },
